    {
      "source": "Spring AI defines 3 primary interfaces to examine these metrics: <code>GenerationMetadata</code>, <code>RateLimit</code> and <code>Usage</code>. All of these interface can be accessed programmatically from the <code>ChatResponse</code> returned and initiated by an AI request.",
      "translation": "Spring AI 定义了 3 个主要接口来查看这些指标：<code>GenerationMetadata</code>、<code>RateLimit</code> 和 <code>Usage</code>。所有这些接口都可以从 AI 请求返回并启动的 <code>ChatResponse</code> 中通过程序方式访问。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>requestsLimit</code> and <code>requestsRemaining</code> let you know how many AI requests, based on the AI provider plan you chose when you signed up, that you can make in total along with your remaining balance within the given timeframe. <code>requestsReset</code> returns a <code>Duration</code> of time before the timeframe expires and your limits reset based on your chosen plan.",
      "translation": "<code>requestsLimit</code> 和 <code>requestsRemaining</code> 将告知您在给定的时间范围内，根据您注册时选择的 AI 提供商方案，您总共可以进行的 AI 请求次数以及当前的剩余余额。<code>requestsReset</code> 返回一个 <code>Duration</code> 类型的时间，表示在当前时间段结束且您的配额根据所选方案重置之前剩余的时间。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "As shown <a href=\"#AiMetadata-GenerationMetadata\">above</a>, <code>Usage</code> data can be obtained from the <code>GenerationMetadata</code> object. The <code>Usage</code> interface is defined as:",
      "translation": "如<a href=\"#AiMetadata-GenerationMetadata\">上方</a>所示，可以从 <code>GenerationMetadata</code> 对象中获取 <code>Usage</code> 数据。<code>Usage</code> 接口定义如下：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The methods for <code>tokensLimit</code>, <code>tokensRemaining</code> and <code>tokensReset</code> are similar to the methods for requests, but focus on token limits, balance and resets instead.",
      "translation": "<code style=\"color: #d73a49;\">tokensLimit</code>、<code style=\"color: #d73a49;\">tokensRemaining</code> 和 <code style=\"color: #d73a49;\">tokensReset</code> 的方法与请求的方法类似，但侧重于 token 限制、余额和重置。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>totalTokens</code> is the sum of <code>promptTokens</code> and <code>generationTokens</code>. Spring AI computes this by default, but the information is returned in the AI response from OpenAI.",
      "translation": "<code>totalTokens</code> 是 <code>promptTokens</code> 和 <code>generationTokens</code> 的总和。Spring AI 默认计算此项，但该信息是包含在来自 OpenAI 的 AI 响应中的。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Use of an AI, such as OpenAI’s ChatGPT, consumes resources and generates metrics returned by the AI provider based on the usage and requests made to the AI through the API.\nConsumption is typically in the form of requests made or tokens used in a given timeframe, such as monthly, that AI providers use to measure this consumption and reset limits.\nYour rate limits are directly determined by your plan when you signed up with your AI provider. For instance, you can review details on OpenAI’s <a href=\"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/rate-limits?context=tier-free\">rate limits</a> and <a href=\"https://openai.com/pricing#language-models\">plans</a> by following the links.",
      "translation": "使用人工智能（例如 OpenAI 的 ChatGPT）会消耗资源，并根据通过 API 对 AI 发出的使用和请求，生成由 AI 提供商返回的指标。\n消耗通常以在给定时间段内（如每月）发出的请求数或使用的 token 数的形式体现，AI 提供商利用这些数据来衡量消耗并重置限制。\n您的速率限制直接取决于您在注册 AI 提供商时选择的方案。例如，您可以点击链接查看 OpenAI 的 <a href=\"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/rate-limits?context=tier-free\">速率限制</a> 和 <a href=\"https://openai.com/pricing#language-models\">方案</a> 详情。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "An instance of <code>GenerationMetadata</code> is automatically created by Spring AI when an AI request is made through the AI provider’s API and an AI response is returned. You can get access to the AI provider metadata from the <code>ChatResponse</code> using:",
      "translation": "当通过 AI 提供商的 API 发起 AI 请求并返回 AI 响应时，Spring AI 会自动创建一个 <code>GenerationMetadata</code> 实例。您可以通过以下方式从 <code>ChatResponse</code> 中获取 AI 提供商的元数据：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <code>RateLimit</code> instance can be acquired from the <code>GenerationMetadata</code>, like so:",
      "translation": "可以通过 <code style=\"color: #d73a49;\">GenerationMetadata</code> 获取 <code style=\"color: #d73a49;\">RateLimit</code> 实例，如下所示：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <code>GenerationMetadata</code> interface is defined as:",
      "translation": "<code style=\"color: #d73a49;\">GenerationMetadata</code> 接口定义如下：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "You might imagine that you can rate limit your own Spring applications using AI, or restrict <code>Prompt</code> sizes, which affect your token usage, in an automated, intelligent and realtime manner.",
      "translation": "您可能会想象，可以通过 AI 以自动化、智能且实时的方式对您自己的 Spring 应用程序进行速率限制，或者限制影响 Token 使用量的 <code>Prompt</code> 大小。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <code>RateLimit</code> interface provides access to actual information returned by an AI provider on your API usage when making AI requests.",
      "translation": "<code style=\"color: #d63384;\">RateLimit</code> 接口提供了在发起 AI 请求时，AI 提供商返回的关于您 API 使用情况的实际信息。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "For AI providers like OpenAI, the rate limit metadata is returned in <a href=\"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/rate-limits/rate-limits-in-headers\">HTTP headers</a> from their (REST) API accessible through HTTP clients, like OkHttp.",
      "translation": "对于像 OpenAI 这样的 AI 提供商，速率限制元数据通过其可通过 OkHttp 等 HTTP 客户端访问的 (REST) API 中的 <a href=\"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/rate-limits/rate-limits-in-headers\">HTTP 响应头</a> 返回。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The method names are self-explanatory, but tells you the tokens that the AI required to process the <code>Prompt</code> and generate a response.",
      "translation": "方法名称本身即有明确含义，但它们会告知你 AI 处理 <code>Prompt</code> 并生成响应所需的 token 数量。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "To help garner insight into your AI (model) consumption and general usage, Spring AI provides an API to introspect the metadata that is returned by AI providers in their APIs.",
      "translation": "为了帮助您深入了解 AI（模型）的消耗情况和总体使用情况，Spring AI 提供了一个 API，用于检索 AI 提供商在其 API 中返回的元数据。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Minimally, you can simply gather these metrics to monitor and report on your consumption.",
      "translation": "至少，您可以只需收集这些指标来监控并报告您的消耗情况。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Because this can be potentially a costly operation, the collection of rate limit AI metadata must be explicitly enabled. You can enable this collection with a Spring AI property in Spring Boot application.properties; for example:",
      "translation": "由于此操作可能产生高昂的成本，因此必须显式启用速率限制 AI 元数据的收集。您可以在 Spring Boot 应用的 application.properties 文件中通过 Spring AI 属性来启用此项收集；例如：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
